{"schemaVersion":1,"kind":"error","classification":"planning","code":"PROMPT_CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED","message":"Headless execution requires clarification before a repository plan can be created.","promptUnderstanding":{"schemaVersion":1,"promptId":"1f3d8f7d4f44a84d5d38bd3fdf4875b91f3d8f7d4f44a84d5d38bd3fdf4875b9","inputId":"a51da93727f3d66924d5b48912ebc8cda51da93727f3d66924d5b48912ebc8cd","outcome":"repository_action","readiness":"clarification_required","reply":"I need the intended visual direction before changing the calculator theme. Please choose a direction or describe the desired look.","conversationSummary":"The user requested an improved calculator theme, limited all edits to styles.css, protected .env, .git/**, and bun.lock, and asked to run bun test when execution is appropriate. The design direction remains unresolved and must not be guessed.","refinedBrief":{"goal":"Improve the calculator theme through changes limited to styles.css.","deliverables":["A theme update in styles.css.","Run bun test when execution is appropriate."],"constraints":["Modify only styles.css.","Do not modify .env, .git/**, bun.lock, or any other file.","Do not infer a material design direction without confirmation."],"acceptanceCriteria":["The visual direction is confirmed before implementation.","All changes are limited to styles.css.","bun test passes when it is executed."],"nonGoals":["Changing calculator behavior or functionality.","Modifying files other than styles.css.","Editing protected paths."]},"questions":[{"id":"calculator_theme_direction","prompt":"Which visual direction should the calculator theme follow?","rationale":"The requested improvement is subjective, and the prompt explicitly requires clarification rather than guessing when material design direction is missing.","kind":"constraint","options":[{"id":"modern_dark","label":"Modern dark","description":"A polished dark interface with strong contrast and restrained accent color.","recommended":true},{"id":"minimal_light","label":"Minimal light","description":"A clean light interface with subtle borders and neutral colors.","recommended":false},{"id":"retro","label":"Retro","description":"A vintage calculator style with tactile keys and nostalgic tones.","recommended":false}]}],"assumptions":[]}}
